Additionally, you can use the `count()` function to ensure that each line has the correct number of syllables. Here's an updated code with this feature:
```
<?php
$line1 = array("cherry", "blossoms", "bloom", "pink", "spring");
$line2 = array("misty", "morning", "sunrise", "golden", "rays");
$line3 = array("crickets", "sing", "quiet", "moon", "night");
